#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:1
msgid "E0063"
msgstr "E0063"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `syntax_lint`"
msgstr "警告名称：`syntax_lint`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:5
msgid "Syntax lint warning."
msgstr "语法 lint 警告。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:7
msgid ""
"This warning category is used for valid code patterns that the compiler "
"accepts but discourages. For example, wrapping a supplied optional "
"argument in `Some` is unnecessary:"
msgstr "编译器会接受此类合法代码模式，但并不推荐。例如，为已提供的可选参数显式包装 `Some` 是不必要的："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn consume(value? : Int) -> Unit {\n"
"  ignore(value)\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn demo() -> Unit {\n"
"  consume(value?=Some(42))\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:17
msgid "Pass the value directly when supplying the optional argument:"
msgstr "为可选参数提供值时，直接传入该值："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn consume(value? : Int) -> Unit {\n"
"  ignore(value)\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn demo() -> Unit {\n"
"  consume(value=42)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0063.md:23
msgid ""
"Other syntax lint diagnostics may report different anti-patterns and "
"provide a suggestion specific to the code being checked."
msgstr "其他语法 lint 诊断可能会报告不同的反模式，并针对正在检查的代码给出相应建议。"
